OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment needs to act faster on
OL,4,Agrooming gang inquiry, says survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survivor of grooming gang abuse has
OL,7,Faccused the Scottish government of
OL,8,Ftaking too long to deliver the public
OL,9,Finquiry it promised "at pace" almost
OL,10,Fnine months ago.
OL,12,FHolly Alex, 36, went into care at the
OL,13,Fage of 14 after her stepfather went to
OL,14,Fprison and her relationship with her
OL,15,Fmother broke down.
