OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment needs to act faster on
OL,4,Agrooming gang inquiry, says survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolly's social care records, seen by
OL,7,FBBC Scotland News, show that staff
OL,8,Frecorded concerns that she was being
OL,9,F"groomed" for sex by "adult Asian men"
OL,10,Fas a teenager. They also indicate
OL,11,Fsocial workers and police knew of the
OL,12,Frisks she faced.
OL,14,FEducation Secretary MC iri McAllan said
OL,15,Fsafeguarding children was the
OL,16,Fgovernment's priority, and the planned
OL,17,Fstatutory inquiry was a core part of
OL,18,Fthis work.
